invalid-quoted-keys.vue:4:3 lint/nursery/noVueDeprecatedDestroyedLifecycle  FIXABLE  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × The beforeDestroy hook was renamed to beforeUnmount in Vue 3.
  
    2 │ <script>
    3 │ export default {
  > 4 │   "beforeDestroy"() {},
      │   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    5 │   'destroyed': function () {},
    6 │   ['beforeDestroy']() {},
  
  i Vue 3 doesn't call the beforeDestroy hook, so the code inside it never runs.
  
  i Rename the hook to beforeUnmount.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
  i Unsafe fix: Rename the hook to beforeUnmount.
  
